      <div type="article" xml:id="PressMint-GB_1896-06-06_WidnesExaminer_art0066" n="art0066">
        <head>DRUGS WON'T DO. FREE TRIAL OF SOMETHING THAT WILL DO.</head>
        <p>DRUGS WON'T DO. FREE TRIAL OF SOMETHING THAT WILL DO.</p>
        <p>You would be perfectly astonished if you were made aw‘..re of the many thousands of pounds absolutely thrown away from year to year upon so-called curatives that are foisted upon a public only too willing to believe the specious arguments laid before them. Even the hard-earned shillings of the very poor ere wasted in this way; in fact, it is tothe ignorant,anxious to rid themsalves of the various ailments which handicap them in the race for life. that such arguments are too often addressed.</p>
        <p>Now, strength and muscular activity, resy cheeks, plumpness, and health, can be obtained without medicine.</p>
        <p>The replenishing of the system from the wasting of tissues which is going on every day can only be accom- plished by the proper assimilation of food. It cannot be done with medi eine. It can, how- ever, be accamplishei with a perfect, flesh-forming, palatable, and agreeable Fond Beverage. Dr. Tib- bles' Vi-Cocoa is such a Food Beverage, possess- ing, as it does, wonierful nourishing, strengthen- ing, and stimulative powers unsurpassed by any other Food Beverage. Dr. Tibbles'Vi.Cocoa is not a medicine. It does simply what it is claimed to do. and its streng- thening p.wers are being recognised to an extent hitherto unknown in the history of any preparation. Merit, and merit alone, is what we claim for Dr. Tibbles' Vi-Cocna, and we are prepared to send to any reader who names the Warrington _Examiner (a post card will do) a dainty sample tin of Dr. Tibbles' Vi-Cocoa tree and post ptid. There is no magic in all this. It is a plain, honest, straight-forward offer. It is done to introduce the merits of Vi-Cocoa into every home. Dr. Tibbles' Vi-Cecoa, as a concentrated form of nourish- ment and vitality, is invaluable ; nay, more than this, for to all who wish to face the strife and battle of life with greater endurance and more sustained exertion, it is absolutely indispensable. Dr. Tibbles' Vi-Cocoa is made up in 6d. packets, and 9d. and is. 6d. tins. It can be obtained from all chemists, grocers, and stores, or from Dr. Tibbles' Vi- Cocoa, Limited, Suffolk House, Cannon-street, London, E.C. (4)</p>
        <p>The Stockport Town Council passed a resolution on Wednesday bh 24 votes to 6, prote.ting against the Agricultural Rating Bill. The giover of the resolution said Stockport would be called upon to contribute £3,800 a year under the Bill, which was equal to a rate of 31d. is the £. Tee Glasgow Corporation Tramways drawing,s for the 12 months ending May atmunted to £327,796 73.—an increase of £lOO,OOO from last year.</p>
