        <p>LANCASHIRE AND CHESHIRE COUNTY BOWLING COMPETITION. WARRINGTON (CEMETERY HOTEL) v. WlGAN.—These teams met on Saturday in the third round of the championship competition on the Lord Nelson Green, Urmston.The green was in splendid condition and capi- tal bowling was witnessed. The Wigan men fancied their chance of success, having played in the final last year. The Warringtonians, however. played exception- ally well, and secured a victory by 31 points, Mr. J. Antriss officiated as referee. _ _ WIGAN.</p>
